# Build context for deploy/aegis/Dockerfile (the repository root).
# Only the paths the Dockerfile copies are sent to the builder; everything else stays out.
**/node_modules
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/.venv
**/.pytest_cache
**/.mypy_cache
**/.ruff_cache
**/.coverage
.git
.github
data
docs
dist
build
*.md
